  "purpose": "Immutable upstream pins for the multi-year Dukascopy FX tick mirror maintained by the FX-Data organisation (populated by fx31337/fx-data-download-action from Dukascopy's public historical feed). Each (symbol, year) is pinned to a git COMMIT sha, not a branch name: branches may move, commits may not. The acquisition script refuses any ref that is not one of these commits.",
